    "summary": "社交媒体上的“弱智”——一种注定亏钱的认知结构",
    "adapter": "generic",
    "metadata": {
      "coverImage": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HHP0T4-akAQd8_l.jpg",
      "language": "zh-cn",
